No Parasolid, SLDASM, or STEP archives are included. The source meshes sew as open shells and are imported with allowOpen for
visualization; volume and boolean behavior are not asserted. The kernelCAD model
converts the URDF's metre translations to millimetres and imports these STL
visuals with lib.fromSTL(...).scale(1000). The CAD rendering is an editable
kinematic visualization; it does not establish simulation, deployed behavior,
or hardware acceptance.
